     {
      "end": 274,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Tahitians\nThe Tahitians , or Maohis , are indigenous peoples of Tahiti and thirteen other Society Islands , as well as the modern population of these lands of mixed ancestry ( demis ) . The Tahitians are one of the most significant indigenous Polynesian peoples of Oceania ."
